[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2676441082","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103191#issuecomment-2676441082","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103191","id":2676441082,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fhz_6","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-22T23:07:06Z","updated_at":"2025-02-22T23:07:06Z","body":"This issue is also reproducible in 4.4 rc 1. Doesn't seems to be related with the `@export` or `@onready`  \n\n```\nvar my_node: Node\nmy_node.set() # Property auto completion will fail\n\nvar my_node = get_node(\"Node\")\nmy_node.set() # Property auto completion will fail\n\nvar my_node = $Node\nmy_node.set() # Property auto completion works\n```\n\n------------------------\n\n@joao-dev152 Please keep all the text in english, this is an english channel so everything should be in english for make the communication easier.\n\nAlso, when you want to add code related words you can wrap the word with \\`. In most of the cases this is not a big deal but the @ is for ping other accounts, so is important wrap this words with \\` to avoid accidental pings.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2676441082/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2689210121","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103191#issuecomment-2689210121","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103191","id":2689210121,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gShcJ","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-27T22:04:08Z","updated_at":"2025-02-27T22:04:08Z","body":"The way argument options are implemented requires an instance of the type at the moment. Such a reduced value can only originate from assigning constant expressions or a get node literal at the moment, furthermore